    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><strong>Visit Cape Cod Cannabis Dispensary in Wellfleet and stock-up with our Pre-420 Deals on Friday 4/18 (8:00 am – 9:00 pm) and Saturday 4/19 (8:00 am – 9:00 pm), and celebrate our 4th Anniversary on Sunday </strong><strong>4/20 (8:00 am – 8:00 pm) that includes exclusive specials, prizes and treats.</strong></p><p><strong>As always, check out our <a href=\"/specials/\">Blazing Bargains &amp; Bundles</a> page for big savings all year round.</strong></p><p><strong>Weed love to see you! Get <a href=\"/directions/\">directions</a> and visit our dispensary to celebrate with us!</strong></p>"
    },
